*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
