**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**12 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The combination of enemies in this stage can be dangerous, as each of the three main threats deals with a different part of your army; H. Nah kills fast melee units, Medu-san kills slow or ranged units, and Cala Maria kills tanky units. The main goal is to take one of them out leaving the other two less protected, preferably Medu-san as she pushes the most out of the three and she stands in the front due to her range.

[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can help deal a lot of damage to the enemies on base hit, especially with [[explosion]] [[Talents|talent]] to increase the damage. A well timed Bahamut can eat more than half of Medu-san's HP leaving light work to your other units.

Both [[Courier Cat]] and [[Fiend Cat]] perform well here due to their decent speed and [[Long Distance]] attacks. [[Can Can Cat]] can be used to deal with the initial peons. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] (especially true form) can ocassionaly dodge Medu-san's surges and hit everyone with a devastating wave.

=='''Recommended Ubers'''==
*Most rusher or tanker role uber rares should do well here as they can stall and damage the threats respectively, preventing them from pushing too fast and buying you a lot of time to kill one of them.

